WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:02.680
Maybe for you there's a tomorrow,

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.700
but for some of us, there's only today.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.720
Hey sexy, get in!

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:15.840
Hi. No I'm eating, get out.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.560
Aw, you guys.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:18.680
Big party tonight,

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:19.980
my mom's going out of town.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.660
Oh my god.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.520
What's she doing here?

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.480
Watch this

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:26.420
Psycho.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.360
What are you doing?

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:40.120
What happened last night?

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.240
What are you talking about?

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.600
I've been having déja-vu all day long.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:48.720
Are you okay?

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.760
It was't a dream. It really happened,

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:54.980
again.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.100
The only way to escape,

00:00:59.100 --> 00:00:59.800
is to change.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:00.800
Watch out for the truck,

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:01.680
What truck?

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.840
I had to do something that would make a difference.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:12.040
Maybe things could change...

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.220
And maybe I could change them.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.340
It's too late,

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.680
it's never too late.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:21.320
Are you in trouble?

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:22.940
You can trust me,

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:24.620
you can trust me back.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.020
Maybe for you there's a tomorrow,

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.960
but for some of us, there's only today.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:38.120
But I didn't know any of that

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.040
until right before I fell.

